OL,3,GNEWSACrew off to New York to retrace
OL,4,A9/11 fireman's steps
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters wearing full equipment
OL,7,Fwill retrace the 5km (3 mile) route of
OL,8,Fan off-duty "colleague" who died in the
OL,9,FSeptember 11 attacks on the World Trade
OL,10,FCenter.
OL,12,FSix serving members from the County
OL,13,FDurham and Darlington Fire and Rescue
OL,14,F(CDDFRS) Service, and eight retired
OL,15,Ffirefighters and their families, will
OL,16,Fjoin about 40,000 others in New York
OL,17,FCity on 27 September.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
