OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACrew off to New York to retrace
OL,4,A9/11 fireman's steps
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey will take part in the Tunnel to
OL,7,FTowers 5K Run & Walk, which follows the
OL,8,Fpath FDNY Stephen Siller took from the
OL,9,FBrooklyn Battery Tunnel to the WTC on
OL,10,Ffoot.
OL,12,FIt is "important" to remember Siller
OL,13,Fwho "ran in the opposite direction to
OL,14,Feveryone else" to save lives," Jamie
OL,15,FSmith, High Handenhold Fire Station
OL,16,Fwatch manager, said.
